import "res://assets/dialogue/dialogue_scripts/7d-Az-ConditionalConvo-CellarGeneral.dialogue" as ConditionalConvo

~ start
Az: Hey Fenn, I got a question for ya. cough You busy?
Fenn: No, I'm by a fireplace.
Az: cough I'm curious, how do you do the thing with the leaves? Where'd you learn it?
Fenn: Uh. I don't really know. I've always been able to do it.
Az: Well, you're pretty good at it. You cough you should be proud.
Fenn: Thanks, I guess.
Az: What's wrong?
Fenn: I dunno. It's weird. It can't really do much. It's just leaves.
Az: Hmph. Well, at least you've been able to get around this place. 
Az: cough Being stuck drives me crazy. I hate it.
Fenn: Why?
Az: I dunno. I wanna help. My Baba's trapped. cough And my stuff is here. I need to make sure everything is safe.
Az: cough I also hate sending you into danger.
Fenn: I'm not in danger! I'm on an adventure!
Az: Sure. Just remember, if you need any help, please use the bangle, okay?
Fenn: No promises! Haha.
Az: Seriously, kid. Use the bangle if you're in trouble.
Fenn: Don't worry, I know!
Az: Alright. Go find that heater and come on back.
do EventFlags.set_flag("Az-FiresideChat-HeaterArea", true)

if EventFlags.num_heaters_activated == 0
	=> ConditionalConvo/start
=> END